                            "plural-only"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ff550e2b-2a69-41cf-aa6d-f86f07b0ac68",
                                "sense_id": "0cc4bbb9-1242-34f1-b414-3634882a4a9a",
                                "text": "When are we going to get some eats?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f8cb557e-f915-40cc-ba94-cb2dd50c17c7",
                                "sense_id": "0cc4bbb9-1242-34f1-b414-3634882a4a9a",
                                "text": "The shower made me feel better, but I was still hungry.\n\"I'm going to grab some eats.\"\n\"Dinner will be waiting for you at home.\"\n\"I'M GOING TO GRAB SOME EATS.\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0f2fa530-b768-4c9a-9483-46e1c26c63ca",
                                "sense_id": "0cc4bbb9-1242-34f1-b414-3634882a4a9a",
                                "text": "At most of these parties, no one knew who the host was, and you just heard from a friend that there was one, you got some eats and off you went."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "23d3d662-b9f7-43c3-8ecd-06946c0bc0bd",
                                "sense_id": "0cc4bbb9-1242-34f1-b414-3634882a4a9a",
                                "text": "Buggs sighed. He would have preferred to go get some eats too, but Ermin was right."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
